# Must-fail mutant for legacy-invoices.mappers.test.ts (AC-7, T48).
#
# Mutates `mapLegacyInvoice` — drops the preserved-bill half of the
# projection, publishing `content: {}` instead of `raw.content` (design.md
# §8.11's declared mutation point for the mappers unit specification: "one
# half of the projection, dropped").
